{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101804","id":2797692450,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6mwWYi","number":101804,"title":"Script editor reports parse error if last character of the file is `)` when creating inline lambdas","user":{"login":"coppolaemilio","id":2206700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDY3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2206700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio","html_url":"https://github.com/coppolaemilio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-01-19T15:46:07Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T11:32:21Z","closed_at":"2025-01-21T00:26:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - macOS Sequoia (15.2.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 Pro - Apple M1 Pro (10 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the last character of a script is the closing `)` of a `connect(func()`, it will give you an error. Otherwise, it says it is good.\nI think this video explains it better:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79832985-b058-4479-86d6-50d4d1a2a5b4\n\nI run into this a lot of the time because I connect button's `pressed` signals this way:\n\n```gdscript\n$Play/ButtonSinglePlayer.pressed.connect(func():\n\tGlobal.game_mode = \"Single\"\n\tget_tree().change_scene_to_file(\"res://SinglePlayer/Start.tscn\")\n)\n```\n\nBut since this error seems to be in the gdscript editor itself, it happens with anything else.\n\nPossibly related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97204\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create an empty project\n- Create a script\n- Paste:\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tdraw.connect(func():\n\tprint('hello world')\n\t)\n```\n- Notice how if the last character is `)` it will give you an error. \n- If you add a white-space, a line break or anything after it, it will not show the error.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[lamda-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18469368/lamda-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"coppolaemilio","id":2206700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDY3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2206700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio","html_url":"https://github.com/coppolaemilio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}